<title>UK: SuedwestLB sets 150 mln Swiss franc five-year bond.</title>
<headline>SuedwestLB sets 150 mln Swiss franc five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GIROZENTRALE</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.50 PCT  MATURITY    20.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.20     PAY DATE    20.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   30.JAN.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) FIVE</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
